---
import Base from './Base.astro';
const { frontmatter: fm } = Astro.props;
---
<Base title={fm.title} description={fm.summary}>
  <article>
    <p class="meta">{fm.date} // {fm.stage}</p>
    <h1>{fm.title}</h1>
    <div class="panel m">
      <p>Built with AI agents under the owner's direction: the notes, code, evaluation and this post were mostly written by Claude Code agents. The owner ran the steps agents may not run: the gate patch, the approvals, the terminal-demo recording (vhs) and the snapshot rollback. Numbers are quoted from reports in the repository's <code>project/reports/L0/</code>; anything not run is marked "not tested".</p>
    </div>
    <slot />
  </article>
</Base>
